# Local settings of the simulator: copy to sim/.env (ignored by git) and
# uncomment what this machine needs. Variables already set in the shell win.
# Without CC the simulator uses zig cc from sim/requirements.txt.

# Another C compiler, as a command (quote paths with spaces on Windows):
# CC=/usr/bin/clang
# CC=C:\msys64\ucrt64\bin\gcc.exe

# macOS with a system compiler whose SDK is broken or missing:
# SDKROOT=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk
